// The volcano, its summit crater at (0, 0): a wide cone with concave flanks lit from the
// west (right), a snow cap whose fingers run down the gullies, and dark lava ridges between
// them. Still; the host lights it and hides its foot behind hills.

use "fuji-palette.kdl"

